    "tactics": "Pixies are scouts and mischief-makers. They avoid combat if possible, preferring to steal, distract, or mislead. A Cooperative Pixie makes an excellent spy. An Indifferent one might interpret \"distract the guard\" as \"steal the guard's lunch and hide in his helmet.\"",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Needle [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 6 + Melee Combat 1), Reach: 5 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 2 damage (1 + 1 Str)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 2 damage, DR halved (round up) + target makes Fortitude [Easy] save or gains Poisoned (Weak) for 1 hour.</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Invisibility (At-Will): The Pixie can become invisible as a [Minor] action. The invisibility ends if it ### Attacks or casts a weave. Natural Tiny: Has Fortune on Stealth checks. Fairy Dust: Once per short rest, the Pixie can dust one willing creature or itself with faintly luminescent powder. The dusted creature gains Fortune on one saving throw of their choice within the next minute.</p>",
